Subject: Restore original renderer state and matrix decisions outside diagnostics

Upstream-base: 11c0bc65ad2ec21431c5d74f1ac4cbc1e3e2e2c3

Retire invented GL readiness/reset/live-matrix rejection from the original
source path; keep legacy diagnostics explicit. Restore original memory startup
order and matrix Get/Set bodies. Pointer handles/Wii bitfields remain transported.
Canonical GX/MTX headers preserve the complete original frame packet sender.
No renderer startup, resource readiness, GPU or full original-main claim.

